This is an exclusive opportunity for Engineering students to dive into a cutting-edge case challenge, solving real-world problems while gaining invaluable experience. Participants will also have the chance to win exciting rewards and Pre-Placement Offers (PPOs) and Pre-Placement Interview (PPI) opportunities across 100+ positions with Tata Elxsi.
 
